{"id":"654171","name":"玉米发面煎饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654171/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"250g"},{"name":"白面","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"玉米两、白面混合放入盆中。","img":"images/654171/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入糖和酵母粉。","img":"images/654171/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量的温水，揉成面团。","img":"images/654171/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵了半个小时的面。","img":"images/654171/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"满满的蜂窝。","img":"images/654171/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉搓排气后切成小剂子。","img":"images/654171/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"剂子搓成小圆球。","img":"images/654171/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"按压成饼状。","img":"images/654171/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切刀在面饼上划上花纹。","img":"images/654171/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"划好的样子，再次发酵15分钟。","img":"images/654171/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"平底锅放油面饼入锅煎。","img":"images/654171/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煎至两面金黄即熟。","img":"images/654171/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。一口下去，满满的玉米清香。","img":"images/654171/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}